  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Eliminate the structural deficit and create the OBR; cut waste and restrain public sector pay; lower/simplify business taxes and reduce regulation; welfare-to-work with sanctions; protect NHS funding and expand patient choice; raise school standards with rigorous curriculum and free schools; tougher knife crime sentences and elected police commissioners; managed immigration with an annual cap; clean up politics (recall MPs, cut MPs, transparency) and restore civil liberties. TEXT_C: Halt all immigration and deportations; immediate EU withdrawal; repeal Race Relations Act and equalities bodies; ban burka, ritual slaughter, and new mosques; restore capital and corporal punishment; end foreign aid and withdraw from foreign engagements; nationalise telecoms and oppose wind turbines.",
